s worst move, and put Black's lead back up from +14.4 to +36.0. The engine's choice was H1. Having just clawed the margin back, White gave it away again."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "Everything the player ran worked on the current position or on records. `current-position-liberties.js` (via the `inspect` string) lists chains and liberties and applies one named candidate move to show what it captures and the resulting chain. The other commands called tool functions, replayed the actual move list to check captures and the final board, counted regions, and wrote game-100.md, game-100.sgf and AGENTS.md. Nothing looped over empty points to score them, and nothing played a sequence forward.", "stop": false}}